5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to help pick the next exhibition! To make sure we have enough money for the fun stuff, I want to check the loan transport costs over three seasons and the mount-making charges and joiner's rate!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I believe we should consider the operational reality of our team. I would like to examine the conservation lab staffing and backlog, as well as the composition of the volunteer roster.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure we do not simply choose a project that looks impressive on paper, I shall examine the weekend head counts across ten seasons and the five years of visitor comment slips.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"To ensure the gallery can actually accommodate the physical requirements of a new exhibition without systemic failure, I will examine the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings in the gallery.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a joy to be with you all. To make sure our guests have a wonderful experience without any disappointments, I shall look into the lender paperwork against shipping cut-offs and the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a great plan, everyone! I love how we're all looking at different things. I think we'll have a really clear picture of what we can actually do once we see the results!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. By covering the financial, structural, and human elements of the museum's current state, we can avoid making a decision based on optimism alone and instead focus on what is truly sustainable.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A comprehensive approach is indeed the most logical. While others focus on the machinery of the museum, I prefer to focus on the results. The data will reveal whether our ambitions actually align with the public's interest.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, public interest is irrelevant if the building cannot physically support the installation. I believe a pragmatic assessment of our spatial and scheduling constraints is the only way to ensure a successful exhibition.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let us not be too stern. Both the heart of the visitor and the strength of the walls are important. I believe that by listening to all these perspectives, we shall find a lovely balance.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! But that's why it's great we're all here together! We can make sure the building is strong and the visitors are happy all at the same time! I can't wait!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, your enthusiasm is appreciated. However, I believe we must remain mindful that neither the building nor the visitors are served if the staff is stretched beyond their limits. The human capacity is the invisible foundation of every exhibition.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, a foundation is only useful if the structure it supports is actually visited. I find it curious that we prioritize the comfort of the staff over the actual evidence of what draws a crowd.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, a crowd is a liability if the space is overcapacity or the schedule is conflicted. We must prioritize the physical and operational limits of the gallery before we consider the volume of visitors.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"It is so wonderful to see such passion for our museum. Let us remember that we are all on the same team, working together to create something beautiful for everyone to enjoy.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"I totally agree, Shizue! We're all working toward the same goal. I'm just so ready to see what we find out! Let's dive into the records and find the perfect show!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I concur. We have a balanced set of investigations. I look forward to seeing if the records reflect the actual capacity of our team to execute these plans.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Shion,,I shall await the findings with a measured curiosity. It will be interesting to see if the data supports your operational concerns or if it reveals a different priority entirely. I am ready.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I have no further points to add. I will proceed with my investigation to determine the actual physical and scheduling limits of the gallery. I am ready.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I agree. It is a lovely feeling to be in such good company. I shall go and see what the records tell us, and I look forward to hearing all your discoveries soon. I am ready.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
